Derived components, with their upstream sources:

  lib/src/native_runtime.dart
      packages/cc_natives/lib/src/inference/speech/sherpa_onnx_transcriber.dart
      (long-lived worker isolate owning the recognizer, TransferableTypedData
       audio transfer, the empty-`modelType` auto-routing workaround, and the
       per-isolate binding requirement)
      packages/cc_natives/lib/src/inference/speech/
      meeting_diarization_service.dart
      (clustering configuration and the per-speaker embedding audio budget)

  lib/src/models.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/speech/voice_model_manager.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/speech/diarization_model_manager.dart
      (model catalog, archive layout, required-file sets, and the upstream
       release-tag spelling preserved verbatim)

  lib/src/model_registry.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/speech/voice_model_manager.dart
      (install flow: stream to a partial file, extract off the calling isolate,
       verify by required-file existence, clean up on failure)

This package depends on sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx),
Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) k2-fsa. It is consumed as a published
dependency rather than vendored, so no sherpa-onnx source is redistributed here.
